{"id":"245643a3d9f97585","group":"88","path":"88/88-fact-pr-closure.md","title":"fact-pr-closure — Primitive Recursive Closure","display":"fact-pr-closure — Primitive Recursive Closure","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-fact-pr-closure","aliases":["88-fact-pr-closure"],"display":"fact-pr-closure — Primitive Recursive Closure","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[88-df-zero-function]]","[[88-df-successor-function]]","[[88-df-projection-function]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-fact-pr-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-fact-pr-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-pr-closure — Primitive Recursive Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f808bc294509a7d\" href=\"?note=2f808bc294509a7d\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive\">88-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0f63c32733077b50\" href=\"?note=0f63c32733077b50\" title=\"88-df-successor-function\">88-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"78a1a0c916e243a2\" href=\"?note=78a1a0c916e243a2\" title=\"88-df-projection-function\">88-df-projection-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PR}\">\\(\\mathcal{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n\">\\(Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n\\)</span> (typed initial functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\)</span> (primitive-recursion scheme)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\nS_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(Z_k\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to P_i^n\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\n\\bigl(g\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\n\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\nS_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(Z_k\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to P_i^n\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\n\\bigl(g\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\n\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_k\">\\(Z_k\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元零函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"69f9994fe732757d\" href=\"?note=69f9994fe732757d\" title=\"88-df-zero-function\">88-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(S_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> : 数值后继函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0f63c32733077b50\" href=\"?note=0f63c32733077b50\" title=\"88-df-successor-function\">88-df-successor-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> : 投影函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"78a1a0c916e243a2\" href=\"?note=78a1a0c916e243a2\" title=\"88-df-projection-function\">88-df-projection-function</a>)</li>\n<li>原始递归函数类包含初始函数，并在复合和原始递归方案下封闭。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"2f808bc294509a7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"0f63c32733077b50","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-projection-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69f9994fe732757d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$Z_k$ : $k$元零函数 (see [[88-df-zero-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"0f63c32733077b50","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$S_{\\mathbb N}$ : 数值后继函数 (see [[88-df-successor-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-projection-function","status":"resolved","id":"78a1a0c916e243a2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$P$ : 投影函数 (see [[88-df-projection-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"Z_k,S_{\\mathbb N},P_i^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}pr\\text{-}closure} \\vdash\nS_{\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(Z_k\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall i\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(1\\leq i\\leq n\\to P_i^n\\in\\mathcal{PR})\n\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^m}\\;\n\\forall h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\cap\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N^k}\\;\n\\bigl(g\\circ\\langle h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal{PR}\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\n\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal{PR}\n\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"Z_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":1524,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2f808bc294509a7d","69f9994fe732757d","0f63c32733077b50","78a1a0c916e243a2","73df252510501ed2"]}